Percent-encode and decode text for URLs

Usage: tw url <COMMAND>

Commands:
  encode  Percent-encode text for a URL
  decode  Decode percent-encoded text
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
